    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f6778f652eccd6a07ffb1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『樱花赏』可是英里的大舞台——\n那么胜者理所当然，非我莫属啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "058e6e378f99a4635dfb19135082b939ed61873024fa52a5a88bfc15112cec77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
