      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在12月的『阪神两岁雌马锦标』上，\n她在最后的直道冲刺阶段展现出了惊人的后劲，\n一度引发了热烈讨论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "310e51e66d249cfdf84a12cc556ab33af7cfe1cd69dc5f3a84fbfa6f8084ae4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
