      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每当看到在寒风中凛然绽放的白色花朵，\n就能感受到它们不畏冬日严寒的那份坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "181b6d28ab179f2950519f7214b23d21355b843309a8f33ca6c6f51e13ee67fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
